aws cli
aws configure
Pide el access key y avanzamos

aws config
AWS access key: Test
AWS secret key: Test
default region name: us-east-1
default output format: json

crear un log group (cloudwatch logs)
aws --endpoint-url=http://localhost:4566 logs describe-log-groups
aws --endpoint-url=http://localhost:4566 logs create-log-group --log-group-name my /mi-app-test/logs

aws --endpoint-url=http://localhost:4566 logs create-log-stream \
--log-group-name my/mi-app-test/logs \
--log-stream-name my-app-test-local

